v49_b_files	node: _FILES$ lists ./ and ../ first and sorted, Linux in its own order
v52_c_files	node: _READFILE$ of a folder gives an empty string, Linux error 75; _FULLPATH$ is a Windows path
v58_s02_files	node: FILES prints the Windows path of the folder, with backslashes
